MAIN
MOVE TEMP 11 4
MOVE TEMP 12 HALLOCATE TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 13 4
MOVE TEMP 14 HALLOCATE TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 15 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 16 Counter_ved_Count
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 17 5
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 17
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 3 0
MOVE TEMP 18 CALL TEMP 4 ( TEMP 0 TEMP 2 )
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 18
PRINT TEMP 5
END
Counter_ved_Count [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 19 0
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 20
CJUMP TEMP 4 L1
MOVE TEMP 21 0
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 5
JUMP L2
L1  NOOP
PRINT TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 22 1
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 MINUS TEMP 1 TEMP 6
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 23
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 8 0
MOVE TEMP 24 CALL TEMP 9 ( TEMP 0 TEMP 7 )
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 10
L2  NOOP

RETURN TEMP 2
END

